                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Thank you to the seniors of @ActsRetirement in Adamstown for welcoming me recently.\n\nI know these past months have been challenging. Recent cuts to the Social Security Administration, Medicaid, SNAP, and public broadcasting threaten programs that so many of you rely on to live with dignity, stay healthy and stay connected. But I will continue to fight to ensure our seniors have the care, resources and respect you deserve.\n\nMy office is here to help with questions about benefits, Medicare, VA support and more\u2014you are never alone.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": [
                    "ActsRetirement"
                ],
                "text_tagged_users_ids": [
                    "42641727"
                ],
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1755635436,
                "view_count": 193
