                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Last week, I sat down with some of our neighbors in Garrett County. What did they tell me? Our rural families have some real concerns: lack of affordable housing, educational resources stretched thin, Medicaid cuts, the need for more good-paying jobs and for more infrastructure investment. \n\nOver some hot @Traders_Coffee and freshly baked pastries, we discussed how our communities can come together to address these issues and the need to push back against the funding cuts from the federal to county levels. Your stories are an essential part of why I fight every day to have the backs of my constituents in Mountain Maryland. @GCCommissioners @GCMDEconDev",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1757093135,
                "view_count": 174
