                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Half of all moms in rural America deliver their babies on Medicaid. For many families, it\u2019s the only way to get prenatal care and a safe delivery.\nhttps://t.co/5hk3S50oLC",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
