                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Heading into the @HouseAgDems hearing on specialty crop insurance! From Butler's Orchard and Lewis Orchards to every other farm across Maryland, I\u2019m fighting for the policies that help our farmers thrive. Every orchard, field, and family farm matters. \n\nAs Maryland's only voice on the Ag Committee, I\u2019m proud to bring their voices to Washington. @FarmBureauMD",
