                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "At yesterday\u2019s grand opening of Meritus Commons, it was my pleasure to present a certificate to the advocates who made it all possible. @MeritusHealth and their School of Osteopathic Medicine went above and beyond, bringing a new generation of healthcare professionals to Hagerstown and ensuring that those students have a designated, residential space to study and live. I cannot wait to see these future doctors grow and serve the patients they\u2019ve dedicated their careers to helping.",
