                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today is National Rural Health Day, a time to highlight the complex healthcare needs of our rural communities and fight for real solutions. I will always stand up for rural healthcare that is accessible, affordable, and comprehensive. https://t.co/7SQlYxQgvz",
