                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "With Medicaid cuts and hospital closures hitting rural Marylanders hard, advocates like CEO Mark Boucot and Garrett Regional Medical Center\u2019s amazing staff know the needs of our communities incredibly well. When they spoke, I listened.\u00a0\n\nI\u2019m pleased to announce that $1 million in federal aid has been signed into law for their Radiology/Oncology Department Expansion Project. This investment will drastically reduce travel time for cancer patients in Garrett county and surrounding communities. Vital care should never be hours away.",
