                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Whether you\u2019re a dad, mom, grandparent or anyone else, everyone irrespective of zip code, circumstance or party will face higher prices this holiday season. My focus in Congress continues to be affordability and access to healthcare. It\u2019s our job to build a brighter, more prosperous and more equitable future for all Americans.",
